    dcterms:description "Evidence view of the historical product assessment. The numeric summary does not assign a score to each Knowledge or Disposition. Supporting documents retain their own origin; an evaluation record does not imply that the reviewed artifact was produced by evaluation."@en ;
    ontoksd:evidenceBasedOn ontoksd:Task201_ProductAssessmentOccurrence ;
    ontoksd:hasEvidenceType ontoksd:InstructorProductReview ;
    ontoksd:hasSupportDocument ontoksd:Task201_G01_ReviewSource .

